00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:01.949
So all the guys that were
in the room went oh jeez,

00:21:01.949 --> 00:21:03.220
that's terrible.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:04.878
Wow, I feel bad for you.

00:21:04.878 --> 00:21:06.500
It wasn't the end of the world,

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:09.610
but it was one of those humiliating days

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:12.420
where you just gotta
suck it up and go fuck,

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.997
am I gonna quit over it?

00:21:13.997 --> 00:21:14.830
No.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:16.563
Am I gonna learn from it?

00:21:16.563 --> 00:21:21.563
Hopefully I'll learn from it
but it does bruise your ego

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.570
and you just gotta get up when
you fall in this industry,

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:25.753
you gotta get up and
move on and if you don't,

00:21:26.669 --> 00:21:28.050
you're not gonna last long.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.010
Everyone has good days
and everyone has bad days.

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.470
What's your batting
average, that's what counts.

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:34.637
- [Mark] Excellent.

00:21:34.637 --> 00:21:36.117
Well Jack, thank you so
much for talking to me.

00:21:36.117 --> 00:21:37.780
- Well, thank you,
thank you for havin' me.

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:39.170
Honestly, if you didn't have other people,

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.480
I'd sit in here all day
and talk to you (laughs)

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.419
I got tell you a million stories.

00:21:42.419 --> 00:21:43.252
- No, that was great.

00:21:43.252 --> 00:21:44.085
- Cool.

00:21:44.085 --> 00:21:44.918
- Great stories.

00:21:44.918 --> 00:21:45.751
- Well, thank you so much for havin' me.

00:21:45.751 --> 00:21:47.101
- [Mark] Excellent, thanks.

